WEBVTT

00:01.797 --> 00:05.137
[PHOENIX] We are
the proud knights of Earl Steim!

00:06.057 --> 00:08.517
The Blood Witch
bears down upon us,

00:08.597 --> 00:11.187
but with the Sword
of Transcendence,

00:11.267 --> 00:13.607
there is naught for us to fear!

00:14.227 --> 00:15.477
[soldiers cheering]

00:15.567 --> 00:17.317
Never seen a sword
glow like that.

00:17.937 --> 00:20.487
Is it more powerful
than a normal boss weapon?

00:22.907 --> 00:25.027
If it is, that's gonna
make clearing this quest

00:25.117 --> 00:26.987
a bigger pain in my ass.

00:27.617 --> 00:29.407
How should I deal with this?

00:29.497 --> 00:30.417
Uh.

00:30.497 --> 00:32.627
[thunder rumbling]

00:34.287 --> 00:35.877
Uh? What's this?

00:38.457 --> 00:40.717
[groans softly]

00:45.807 --> 00:48.727
-[YATAN] Do you desire power?
-[YURA] Huh?

00:50.887 --> 00:54.767
[YATAN] If you desire power,
wish for it.

00:54.857 --> 00:57.227
Make your desire known,

00:57.317 --> 01:00.067
and I shall grant it to you.

01:00.147 --> 01:03.067
[YURA] Oh, shit,
this is Yatan's voice.

01:04.237 --> 01:08.617
[YATAN] Now,
tell me that which you desire.

01:09.287 --> 01:11.537
If it is power you seek,

01:11.617 --> 01:16.087
allow me
to fulfill your deepest desire.

01:16.537 --> 01:18.587
I will grant you power.

01:18.667 --> 01:20.167
I will grant you power.

01:20.257 --> 01:23.677
If you desire power,
wish for it.

01:23.757 --> 01:26.507
If you desire power,
wish for it.

01:26.597 --> 01:29.057
I will grant you power.
I will grant you power.

01:29.137 --> 01:30.807
I will grant you power.

01:30.887 --> 01:33.227
- I will grant you power!
-[YURA] I...

01:33.307 --> 01:36.057
I will grant you power!

01:37.687 --> 01:39.187
I wish for power.

01:44.817 --> 01:46.317
Give me the strength
to strike down

01:46.407 --> 01:48.237
that which
my black magic cannot.

01:50.077 --> 01:52.037
[♪ opening theme song playing]

03:23.297 --> 03:25.837
[TAKUMI] After I crafted
that kickass legendary sword,

03:25.917 --> 03:28.547
my stats shot
through the frickin' roof.

03:28.637 --> 03:30.097
Which is great,
but the family's still

03:30.177 --> 03:31.887
60 million yen in the hole.

03:31.967 --> 03:34.217
So now, if I'm gonna save them,

03:34.307 --> 03:36.727
I gotta lock in
and use these fat stats

03:36.807 --> 03:38.097
to make fat stacks.

03:39.687 --> 03:41.307
-[grunting]
-[metal clanging]

03:41.397 --> 03:42.477
Oi, Grid.

03:42.567 --> 03:44.777
What are you
tinkering with, there?

03:44.857 --> 03:47.697
Ah. Yeah, I figured
I'd better craft a new hammer.

03:48.157 --> 03:50.987
I had been using the pile of
broken ones lying around here,

03:51.067 --> 03:52.317
but these hammers ain't hammin'.

03:52.407 --> 03:54.287
Broken ones? Are you daft?

03:54.367 --> 03:56.997
A blacksmith's hammer
is his very life!

03:57.077 --> 03:58.827
Oh, is it now?

03:58.917 --> 04:00.127
-[KHAN] Wait here.
-Huh?

04:01.377 --> 04:02.997
[KHAN] Mm-hmm.

04:03.497 --> 04:04.587
Ah.

04:06.507 --> 04:07.757
Here you are.

04:07.837 --> 04:08.967
This one's mine.

04:09.047 --> 04:10.637
[TAKUMI]
Excellent Blacksmith's Hammer,

04:10.717 --> 04:13.597
rare item crafting rate +10%?
What the hell?!

04:13.677 --> 04:16.097
Now, honestly, lad.

04:16.177 --> 04:18.687
A better hammer would've
saved you days of work.

04:18.767 --> 04:21.057
-Maybe even weeks if--
-You sandbagging son of a bitch!

04:21.147 --> 04:22.807
Why haven't you told me
this stuff?!

04:26.687 --> 04:28.197
-Ah! My baby!
-[laughs]

04:28.277 --> 04:29.697
You have your father's eyes.

04:29.777 --> 04:31.817
Ever since you came
into my life,

04:31.907 --> 04:33.867
I've found myself laughing more.

04:34.327 --> 04:36.657
Oh, I'm glad my digital blood,
sweat, and tears

04:36.747 --> 04:37.657
is a joke to you.

04:38.577 --> 04:41.707
By the way, I have a favor
I'd like to ask you.

04:41.787 --> 04:43.667
Really? After all this?

04:44.747 --> 04:47.797
It's the anniversary
of my son's death.

04:47.877 --> 04:48.917
I was wondering

04:49.297 --> 04:51.177
if you'd be willing
to go to his grave with me.

04:52.137 --> 04:54.967
[♪ gentle music playing]

04:58.467 --> 05:01.267
Generations of my family
are buried here.

05:03.267 --> 05:07.017
And this, this is where
I laid my son Oliver to rest.

05:08.027 --> 05:10.947
One of the finest blacksmiths
I've ever known.

05:11.567 --> 05:13.947
I planned for him
to take over the forge,

05:14.027 --> 05:17.737
but he died so young,
he never got the chance.

05:19.537 --> 05:22.497
It's been 10 years
since he passed.

05:22.997 --> 05:26.167
Not a day goes by where
I don't think of my sweet boy.

05:26.247 --> 05:27.627
[sighs]

05:28.457 --> 05:29.917
[TAKUMI] NPCs aren't real,

05:30.507 --> 05:32.677
but I guess even they care
about their families.

05:36.847 --> 05:38.137
Oliver,

05:38.807 --> 05:41.427
you'll never believe
who I brought with me today.

05:42.187 --> 05:44.597
You wanted
to meet Pagma's Successor?

05:44.687 --> 05:46.687
Well, he's right here beside me.

05:47.937 --> 05:49.527
You'd be proud.

05:49.607 --> 05:52.277
I have the pleasure
of working with him every day.

05:52.857 --> 05:56.157
He's real,
and he saved our forge.

05:56.237 --> 05:59.577
Because of him,
I swore off the drink.

05:59.657 --> 06:02.617
He's a good lad,
reminds me a lot of you.

06:02.707 --> 06:04.287
So much so,

06:04.367 --> 06:07.127
I'd like to hand
the forge down to him.

06:07.207 --> 06:08.337
Huh?

06:11.707 --> 06:12.837
It's true.

06:12.917 --> 06:14.547
I want you to take it.

06:16.467 --> 06:17.797
You serious, Khan?

06:18.427 --> 06:21.217
Damn, Satisfy.
Punch me in the heart.

06:21.847 --> 06:23.807
What kind of game
is this, anyway?

06:25.017 --> 06:26.397
'Sup, Oliver?

06:26.477 --> 06:27.607
My name's Grid.

06:28.517 --> 06:31.357
Your dad is my teacher,
and he's my friend too.

06:31.437 --> 06:34.527
Actually, he's kinda become
like my best friend.

06:35.237 --> 06:37.617
That forge was
supposed to be yours.

06:37.697 --> 06:39.867
I'll make sure
the whole world knows its name.

06:40.447 --> 06:41.487
So, hey.

06:42.117 --> 06:44.497
While me and your old man
are working down here,

06:44.577 --> 06:46.627
you keep an eye on us up there.

06:47.127 --> 06:48.537
Grid, my boy.

06:51.247 --> 06:52.457
[Takumi gasps]

06:54.167 --> 06:55.467
[grunts]

06:56.507 --> 06:58.467
-[Khan groans]
-[TAKUMI] Huh?

07:00.097 --> 07:02.967
Uh. What the shit?

07:05.187 --> 07:06.727
[GAME VOICE] System guidance.

07:06.807 --> 07:09.017
Moved by your care
and devotion to Khan,

07:09.107 --> 07:11.397
his ancestors have appeared
before you.

07:13.937 --> 07:14.857
[screams]

07:15.487 --> 07:17.697
[ANCESTOR 1] Pagma's Successor.

07:17.777 --> 07:19.567
[ANCESTOR 2]
Friend of our descendant.

07:20.157 --> 07:22.117
Tasukete, Mommy!

07:22.197 --> 07:23.867
[ANCESTOR 1] We have risen

07:23.947 --> 07:27.537
to offer our gratitude
for your kindness.

07:28.167 --> 07:29.377
[TAKUMI] You're thanking me?

07:29.457 --> 07:32.457
[ANCESTOR 1] 130 years ago,

07:32.547 --> 07:36.467
I was awestruck
by the mighty blade of Pagma.

07:38.007 --> 07:40.087
I sketched every detail

07:40.177 --> 07:43.057
so I would never forget
his sword dance.

07:43.137 --> 07:48.437
The mural lies on the cliffs
of Kesan Canyon.

07:48.937 --> 07:49.977
[Takumi gasps]

07:51.227 --> 07:52.607
[GAME VOICE] System guidance.

07:52.687 --> 07:55.067
You have begun
the legendary job quest,

07:55.147 --> 07:57.447
"Pagma's Successor, Part One."

07:57.527 --> 07:59.197
[TAKUMI] This is it,
the job quest

07:59.277 --> 08:00.947
for my legendary class.

08:01.027 --> 08:02.117
I did it.

08:02.197 --> 08:04.447
I finally got the first one!

08:06.497 --> 08:09.077
[ANCESTOR 1]
Dear friend of my descendant,

08:09.917 --> 08:12.787
may you rise
and become even greater

08:12.877 --> 08:15.547
than Pagma was before you.

08:15.627 --> 08:17.457
-[OLIVER] Before you go...
-[gasps]

08:18.087 --> 08:19.337
...I'll need you to promise

08:19.427 --> 08:21.047
that you'll take care
of my father.

08:21.547 --> 08:22.927
Please, Grid.

08:24.467 --> 08:25.427
[inhales]

08:26.267 --> 08:27.217
Of course.

08:27.307 --> 08:28.727
You can rest easy.

08:29.137 --> 08:30.187
[chuckles]

08:41.237 --> 08:44.237
[groans, mumbles]

08:45.027 --> 08:48.247
Oh, sorry.
Seems I nodded off there.

08:50.537 --> 08:51.917
[TAKUMI] Come on, man.

08:51.997 --> 08:53.627
Falling asleep in a graveyard?

08:54.707 --> 08:55.917
Get it together.

08:56.497 --> 08:59.047
[BOTH] You really need to take
better care of yourself.

08:59.127 --> 09:00.047
[OLIVER] Father.

09:02.837 --> 09:04.467
Oh, Grid.

09:04.547 --> 09:06.717
W-Why are you still
turned away from me?

09:06.807 --> 09:08.477
[TAKUMI]
Mind your goddamn business.

09:08.557 --> 09:10.557
[gasps]

09:10.637 --> 09:12.637
[groans]

09:12.727 --> 09:15.267
You monster.

09:19.237 --> 09:20.487
[SUMITA] In the Eternal Kingdom,

09:20.567 --> 09:22.777
Earl Steim's army has,
once again,

09:22.857 --> 09:25.737
failed in its attempt
to eradicate the Yatan Church.

09:26.737 --> 09:29.037
The North's most
decorated knight, Phoenix,

09:29.117 --> 09:31.827
survived the encounter,
but just barely.

09:32.407 --> 09:34.787
Quests are being issued
all across the continent

09:34.877 --> 09:37.877
in an attempt
to stop the church's expansion.

09:37.957 --> 09:39.627
With famous guilds
leaping into action,

09:39.707 --> 09:41.837
the world is watching
to see if any

09:41.917 --> 09:43.677
of the top - ranked players
will join the fight.

09:44.887 --> 09:48.307
I, Black Mage Yura,
am the Eighth Servant of Yatan.

09:48.387 --> 09:51.477
I have finally transcended
the limits of my class.

09:52.227 --> 09:54.137
[SUMITA]
The Yatan Church is expected

09:54.227 --> 09:57.187
to continue growing
in both power and influence,

09:57.267 --> 09:59.187
emerging as a global threat.

09:59.267 --> 10:01.067
[IRENE]
...crush them once and for all!

10:01.147 --> 10:03.777
Glory and praise
to the goddess Rebecca!

10:04.817 --> 10:08.577
Many countries will ally
with one purpose, stop the cult.

10:08.657 --> 10:10.827
In fact,
in the history of Satisfy,

10:10.907 --> 10:13.747
this is
its all-time greatest crisis.

10:14.327 --> 10:15.997
This is not
an isolated incident.

10:16.077 --> 10:18.837
The war will affect every player
in the game.

10:18.917 --> 10:21.047
All the quests are
about joining the army.

10:21.127 --> 10:22.167
I hear they're losing...

10:22.467 --> 10:23.547
[TAKUMI] Lately,
all anybody can talk about

10:23.627 --> 10:25.507
is the war
with the Yatan Church.

10:25.587 --> 10:27.257
But that can wait.

10:27.347 --> 10:29.297
My goal is to clear
my first job quest!

10:29.387 --> 10:31.927
-[Huroi gasps] Master Grid!
-Hmm?

10:32.017 --> 10:33.267
What? Who?

10:33.347 --> 10:34.727
Huroi?!

10:34.807 --> 10:36.767
Yes! 'Tis your sidekick, Huroi!

10:37.647 --> 10:39.817
I have returned, ready to serve
as your partner!

10:39.897 --> 10:42.107
It's about damn time!
Where the hell have you been?!

10:42.187 --> 10:43.647
You know what kind of shit
I had to go through

10:43.737 --> 10:45.067
after you bailed on my ass?!

10:45.147 --> 10:46.407
Sir, I am so sorry!

10:46.487 --> 10:48.067
The game wouldn't
let me log back in

10:48.157 --> 10:49.577
-until I made a full recovery!
-[Takumi growls]

10:49.657 --> 10:50.657
Like I care!

10:50.987 --> 10:53.407
-Shoo! Bye, bitch!
-[gasps] "Bye, bitch"? No!

10:53.497 --> 10:55.287
A true descendant
of the great blue wolf

10:55.367 --> 10:57.497
is swearing
his eternal loyalty to you!

10:57.577 --> 10:58.587
You're my hero!

10:58.667 --> 10:59.747
I never would have been able

10:59.837 --> 11:02.047
to unlock this second job
without you!

11:02.127 --> 11:03.337
Are you freaking shitting me?

11:03.417 --> 11:04.797
You're the one
who got the second job?!

11:04.877 --> 11:06.837
[HUROI] I thought they
made that information public

11:06.927 --> 11:07.967
after it happened.

11:08.047 --> 11:09.797
Why is Lady Luck
putting out for you

11:09.887 --> 11:11.427
when she won't
even open my DMs?!

11:11.507 --> 11:12.847
[HUROI] Please, my lord!

11:12.927 --> 11:15.677
All I want is to devote myself
to your pleasure!

11:15.767 --> 11:16.977
Whoa, what the hell?

11:17.057 --> 11:18.227
[MAN] You think
we should report that guy?

11:18.307 --> 11:19.607
[HUROI] Just let me serve you!

11:20.267 --> 11:21.767
Dude, don't talk to me,
don't look at me,

11:21.857 --> 11:23.567
and do not talk
about my pleasure!

11:23.647 --> 11:25.357
Master, wait!

11:25.437 --> 11:27.647
[Takumi huffs]
Forget that idiot Huroi!

11:28.487 --> 11:31.277
I need to focus on tracking down
that Pagma clue, that's it.

11:31.367 --> 11:32.737
But...

11:33.407 --> 11:36.747
I'm pretty sure Kesan Canyon
is packed with level-160 mobs.

11:37.457 --> 11:39.417
And even though
I have a legendary job,

11:39.497 --> 11:41.287
I'm still only level 45.

11:41.667 --> 11:43.127
There's no way
that's high enough,

11:43.207 --> 11:44.417
even with my gear.

11:44.507 --> 11:45.417
Uh.

11:49.507 --> 11:52.637
[KHAN] You wanna try your hand
at a stealth item, eh?

11:52.717 --> 11:53.717
Well, then.

11:54.177 --> 11:56.387
You're gonna have to
get yourself a Sylphid Scale.

11:56.477 --> 11:58.437
Wait, sylph, like a fairy?

11:58.517 --> 11:59.937
[KHAN] Yes.

12:00.017 --> 12:01.897
Sylphids are tiny wind fairies

12:01.977 --> 12:04.227
whose scales
have protective coloring.

12:04.317 --> 12:07.607
Though, as an ingredient,
it's classified as cloth.

12:07.687 --> 12:09.197
Okay, cloth then.

12:11.157 --> 12:12.527
[GAME VOICE] System guidance.

12:12.617 --> 12:15.997
You are using the skill
"Legendary Blacksmith Creation."

12:16.077 --> 12:18.787
- What kind of item would--
-A cape using a Sylphid Scale.

12:20.077 --> 12:21.577
- Please design the item.
-[TAKUMI] Okay, I got this.

12:23.997 --> 12:25.247
[GAME VOICE]
Bonuses have been added.

12:25.337 --> 12:26.837
[TAKUMI] Oh, sick.

12:26.917 --> 12:29.587
Now where can I wrangle me up
one of them Sylphid Scales?

12:29.677 --> 12:32.297
Oh, going on the hunt already?

12:32.387 --> 12:33.427
Let's see.

12:33.507 --> 12:34.927
If you wanna stay close,

12:35.007 --> 12:38.477
snuff out some Frost Orcs
in the Northern Snowfields.

12:38.557 --> 12:41.647
They're quite keen on hunting
Sylphids for their scales.

12:41.727 --> 12:44.057
It's a natural instinct
for the beast.

12:44.897 --> 12:48.687
Fighting orcs should be easier
than catching invisible fairies.

12:49.357 --> 12:50.527
Orcs, you say?

12:50.607 --> 12:51.987
Let's get farmin'!

12:52.067 --> 12:53.907
[metal clanging rapidly]

12:57.197 --> 12:59.407
[TAKUMI] I crafted myself
some fine - ass furs

12:59.497 --> 13:00.867
for the Northern Snowfields!

13:00.957 --> 13:02.207
Very cozy.

13:02.537 --> 13:04.787
[GAME VOICE] You have received
an equipment set bonus.

13:05.417 --> 13:07.417
[KHAN]
Just be careful out there.

13:07.507 --> 13:08.507
I'll be fine.

13:08.587 --> 13:10.547
I've got the Dagger of Ideals.

13:11.877 --> 13:14.847
[KHAN] That boy doesn't seem
the least bit concerned.

13:15.967 --> 13:19.427
Frost Orcs may drop
Sylphid Scales, but the odds,

13:20.057 --> 13:22.477
I'd say less than 1%, at best.

13:23.977 --> 13:25.857
[wind howling]

13:52.297 --> 13:53.547
[Khan, in English]
My apprentice?

13:53.837 --> 13:56.927
[HUROI] Yes. I'd really like
to be there to lend my aid.

13:57.007 --> 13:58.637
[sighs]

13:58.717 --> 14:00.847
He's in the north,
hunting Frost Orcs

14:00.927 --> 14:02.677
-in the snowfields.
-[Huroi gasps]

14:02.767 --> 14:04.017
So, hey!

14:04.097 --> 14:06.147
I don't speak
zug-zug orc bullshit.

14:06.227 --> 14:09.107
How do you say,
"Give me your Sylphid Scales"?

14:09.187 --> 14:11.277
Take this! Blade Wii--

14:13.067 --> 14:14.107
[in English] Arrows?

14:14.397 --> 14:15.947
Orcs share one brain cell.
They aren't ranged!

14:16.027 --> 14:19.077
-[orcs grunting]
-[Takumi groans]

14:20.867 --> 14:23.207
Shit, when did
these orcs get so jacked?

14:23.287 --> 14:25.117
[GAME VOICE] Warning.
You have less than 10% HP.

14:25.207 --> 14:27.337
[TAKUMI] Even if
my Immortality Skill triggers,

14:27.417 --> 14:28.377
there's too many.

14:29.287 --> 14:30.377
Huh?

14:30.457 --> 14:31.507
[GAME VOICE] System guidance.

14:32.127 --> 14:34.007
The passive ability of the title

14:34.087 --> 14:35.507
- "Apostle of Justice"...
-[TAKUMI] Wait, no way.

14:35.587 --> 14:37.927
This is the title I got
when I saved Huroi!

14:39.467 --> 14:41.557
[GAME VOICE]
You have acquired a new skill.

14:41.637 --> 14:43.427
[Takumi laughs]
Guess saving his wrinkly ass

14:43.517 --> 14:45.187
wasn't a total waste after all!

14:45.267 --> 14:46.347
-[roars]
-[TAKUMI] Take this!

14:46.437 --> 14:50.397
-Unyielding Justice!
-[orcs groan]

14:50.477 --> 14:52.567
♪

14:53.607 --> 14:55.067
[GAME VOICE]
You have leveled up.

14:55.147 --> 14:56.857
Your HP has been restored.

14:56.947 --> 14:59.827
Oh! Yes, new skill, don't stop!

15:00.487 --> 15:04.287
I'm gonna grind
on these orcs all night long!

15:05.327 --> 15:06.617
[shivers]

15:07.247 --> 15:09.497
I'm such a fool
for letting him out of my sight.

15:09.587 --> 15:11.037
He left without me.

15:11.127 --> 15:14.297
It's fine, as the new Partner
of the Apostle of Justice,

15:14.377 --> 15:15.757
I can use a sword and shield.

15:16.797 --> 15:19.717
Don't worry, Grid.
I, Huroi, shall find you.

15:26.477 --> 15:29.227
[TAKUMI] Damn it.
This drop rate is cheeks!

15:29.307 --> 15:30.437
I killed 80 damn orcs

15:30.517 --> 15:32.477
and only got
three freakin' scales!

15:32.567 --> 15:34.187
Guess I shouldn't
complain too much.

15:34.277 --> 15:35.647
After grinding here
for a few days,

15:35.737 --> 15:36.817
I haven't found many scales,

15:36.897 --> 15:38.527
but my level's
practically doubled.

15:39.117 --> 15:40.367
[sighs]

15:40.827 --> 15:42.527
I'll wait
for a few more to respawn.

15:42.617 --> 15:44.787
-[HUROI] Master Grid, I'm here!
-Hmm?

15:44.867 --> 15:46.407
[HUROI] You're safe, my lord!

15:46.497 --> 15:48.917
Huroi.
What are you doing here, man?

15:48.997 --> 15:51.087
Master Khan said
this is where I'd find you.

15:51.167 --> 15:53.917
I never meant
to keep you waiting this long.

15:54.007 --> 15:56.837
Please accept
my humble apology, sir.

15:56.917 --> 15:58.177
Can we not RP right now?

15:58.837 --> 16:00.547
Dude, what did I just say?
Get up!

16:00.637 --> 16:02.257
I don't have time for your weird

16:02.347 --> 16:03.507
-submissive bull--
-[thudding]

16:03.597 --> 16:04.927
[BOTH] Uh?

16:09.597 --> 16:11.727
-[orc chieftain growls]
-[both gasp]

16:15.277 --> 16:17.187
[♪ dramatic music playing]

16:18.737 --> 16:20.317
[GAME VOICE]
You have now entered combat.

16:20.407 --> 16:22.447
Aw, shit. That's boss music.

16:22.527 --> 16:24.117
[HUROI] A field boss!

16:24.197 --> 16:26.327
He spawned because you took out
all the orcs in the village!

16:26.407 --> 16:28.117
And he's level 140!

16:28.207 --> 16:29.207
[TAKUMI] Oh, is that all?

16:29.287 --> 16:30.707
[both scream]

16:30.787 --> 16:32.587
[grunts]

16:32.667 --> 16:35.707
[shrieks]
Huroi, come on! Pull aggro!

16:35.797 --> 16:37.047
[panting] Huh?

16:37.127 --> 16:39.007
You said you'd devote yourself
to my pleasure,

16:39.087 --> 16:41.297
now pleasure me
by pulling the goddamn aggro!

16:41.387 --> 16:44.637
I just realized my Partner
of the Apostle of Justice title

16:44.717 --> 16:47.137
gives me 30% to all stats
when I'm around you!

16:47.227 --> 16:49.767
Cool. Why the hell
should I care, man?

16:49.847 --> 16:51.897
-We can fight it together!
-Ugh!

16:51.977 --> 16:53.937
Fine, whatever, party up!
Let's go!

16:54.017 --> 16:56.147
Dibs on whatever
the big dude drops!

16:56.227 --> 16:57.647
[HUROI] Right! Of course.

16:57.737 --> 16:59.527
[TAKUMI] All right,
sic 'em, Huroi!

16:59.607 --> 17:00.567
[HUROI] O-Okay.

17:00.647 --> 17:02.277
[takes deep breath]

17:03.617 --> 17:05.657
You piece of shit orc!

17:05.737 --> 17:07.157
Get the hell out of my way,

17:07.237 --> 17:09.117
you ass-reeking
overgrown piglet!

17:09.197 --> 17:11.617
I'll grind you up into orc pork!

17:11.707 --> 17:13.247
[orcs growling]

17:13.327 --> 17:15.587
[GAME VOICE] "The Blacksmith's
Wrath" skill has activated.

17:15.667 --> 17:17.167
Taste my pain, bitch!

17:17.247 --> 17:19.087
Unyielding Justice!

17:19.667 --> 17:22.047
[GAME VOICE] You defeated
the Frost Orc horde.

17:22.127 --> 17:24.257
Hell yeah!
Now it's just the big boy!

17:24.347 --> 17:26.557
-Uh...
-[orc chieftain growls]

17:26.637 --> 17:29.677
So, uh, my taunt effect ran out.
I'm sorry!

17:29.767 --> 17:31.727
Oh, that's good to know!
Damn it!

17:32.187 --> 17:33.267
Blade Wind!

17:33.347 --> 17:34.807
Now, Huroi!

17:34.897 --> 17:36.107
[HUROI] Right, on it!

17:36.647 --> 17:38.567
[yells]

17:39.187 --> 17:40.777
Unyielding Justice!

17:41.397 --> 17:42.607
[groans]

17:42.697 --> 17:44.527
Whoa, we can both use Justice?

17:44.617 --> 17:46.487
Let's double-Justice his ass!

17:46.577 --> 17:47.827
[growls]

17:47.907 --> 17:49.327
[both gasp, yell]

17:50.117 --> 17:51.197
[both groan]

17:52.707 --> 17:56.287
[Takumi groans] Just one attack
does that much damage?

17:56.377 --> 17:59.497
[groaning]

18:00.757 --> 18:02.337
[gasps] Huroi!

18:02.417 --> 18:05.087
Ah, shit.
Idiot went and got knocked out.

18:05.847 --> 18:08.427
-[orc chieftain growls]
-[Takumi gasps] Of course.

18:08.507 --> 18:10.677
Go for the unconscious victim,
you dick.

18:11.307 --> 18:13.977
What do I do?
I can't handle him on my own!

18:14.057 --> 18:16.897
Just look at him!
Dude's built like a brick house!

18:16.977 --> 18:18.517
This shit's so ass.

18:18.607 --> 18:20.647
I should just let him
have Huroi and bounce.

18:21.277 --> 18:24.027
No.
If I do that, Huroi will die!

18:24.107 --> 18:25.107
[gulps]

18:25.777 --> 18:27.577
[roars]

18:27.657 --> 18:29.287
[Takumi gasps] Huh?

18:29.367 --> 18:30.867
[GAME VOICE] System guidance.

18:30.947 --> 18:35.117
The passive skill of the title
"Legendary One" has activated.

18:35.207 --> 18:38.087
You now have immunity
to all status effects.

18:38.167 --> 18:39.297
[Takumi exhales]

18:39.997 --> 18:43.417
It's like my fear's fading away.

18:43.507 --> 18:46.927
I've always been a supporting
character in my own life.

18:47.637 --> 18:49.677
But here, in Satisfy,

18:49.757 --> 18:51.467
I choose
to be the main character.

18:52.557 --> 18:55.057
And everybody knows
the MC always wins.

18:56.387 --> 18:58.397
So no matter what I face...

18:59.647 --> 19:03.527
You are gonna have one hell
of a time taking me down!

19:03.607 --> 19:05.107
[loud thud]

19:08.157 --> 19:10.197
[groans]

19:10.277 --> 19:11.537
[gasps]

19:12.157 --> 19:13.197
[gasps]

19:13.287 --> 19:15.407
[orc chieftain growls]

19:15.497 --> 19:17.457
[HUROI] Master Grid.

19:17.537 --> 19:18.667
[coughs]

19:18.747 --> 19:21.207
I'm the one leading
this stupid boss raid.

19:21.297 --> 19:23.837
Can't let my sidekick
be the hero.

19:24.457 --> 19:25.877
[HUROI] Master Grid!

19:26.547 --> 19:28.007
[groans]

19:28.087 --> 19:30.387
Actually,
I think I'm gonna go and heal.

19:30.467 --> 19:32.007
Can you draw aggro
again, please?

19:32.637 --> 19:34.137
[HUROI] This is my fault.

19:34.217 --> 19:36.767
I'm sorry you had to
come and rescue me.

19:36.847 --> 19:38.227
[TAKUMI] Incoming!

19:38.307 --> 19:39.687
[HUROI] Have no fear, sir.

19:39.767 --> 19:43.227
Whatever he tries to do,
I swear I'll block it!

19:43.317 --> 19:44.477
[orc chieftain groans]

19:44.567 --> 19:46.237
[HUROI] Indomitable Will!

19:46.317 --> 19:48.197
Your attacks can't touch me!

19:48.277 --> 19:50.197
Do your worst! Hear me?

19:51.077 --> 19:52.117
Take this!

19:52.197 --> 19:53.947
[groans]

19:54.037 --> 19:55.537
You have fire bottles?

19:55.617 --> 19:56.957
Where the hell
did you get those?

19:57.037 --> 20:00.207
[groaning]

20:00.287 --> 20:01.837
[gasps]

20:01.917 --> 20:03.297
[both gasp]

20:03.587 --> 20:06.627
[Takumi gasps] Bullshit!
Orcs can't use stat boost items!

20:07.257 --> 20:08.877
[yells]

20:09.507 --> 20:10.887
Damn it!
What are we gonna do now?

20:11.507 --> 20:14.097
[HUROI] Master Grid,
I leave the rest to you.

20:14.177 --> 20:15.807
Huh? Dude, what are you...

20:16.097 --> 20:17.057
[gasps]

20:17.677 --> 20:18.847
[HUROI] I have this technique.

20:18.937 --> 20:20.727
Just been waiting
for the right time.

20:28.237 --> 20:30.447
It's called
Sacrifice For Justice.

20:32.447 --> 20:33.367
[shatters]

20:37.287 --> 20:39.037
[yells]

20:41.417 --> 20:45.247
-[groaning]
-[yelling]

20:47.797 --> 20:49.297
[orc chieftain groans]

20:50.467 --> 20:51.887
[HUROI] Guess it didn't work.

20:53.097 --> 20:54.007
What did you do?

20:55.137 --> 20:57.677
[HUROI] I'm sorry.
That didn't go the way I hoped.

20:58.517 --> 21:01.687
But at least I was able
to lower his defense for you.

21:01.767 --> 21:02.937
Huroi.

21:03.357 --> 21:04.437
[HUROI] Good luck...

21:05.187 --> 21:07.317
Master Grid.

21:09.067 --> 21:11.987
[GAME VOICE] Party member
Huroi has perished in battle.

21:13.777 --> 21:15.117
[TAKUMI] You're a little clingy,

21:15.657 --> 21:17.327
and I think
you might be a stalker.

21:18.197 --> 21:19.367
But thanks, bro.

21:20.537 --> 21:23.377
You did the tankin',
I'll do the spankin'.

21:23.877 --> 21:25.747
[both grunting]

21:29.627 --> 21:30.877
[GAME VOICE] Cooldown complete.

21:30.967 --> 21:32.717
Skill is now ready to use.

21:32.797 --> 21:35.257
The passive skill
granted by the title

21:35.347 --> 21:38.097
"Apostle of Justice"
has activated.

21:38.177 --> 21:41.137
[grunts] Ah, shit,
here we go again!

21:45.307 --> 21:47.567
Unyielding Justice!

21:47.647 --> 21:49.897
[yells]

21:53.487 --> 21:56.657
[GAME VOICE] You have defeated
the Frost Orc Chieftain.

21:56.737 --> 21:57.827
[panting]

21:59.157 --> 22:00.117
[inhales]

22:00.197 --> 22:01.497
We did it.

22:01.577 --> 22:03.537
We did it! [laughs]

22:03.617 --> 22:05.327
You see that shit, Huroi?!

22:05.417 --> 22:06.787
And don't worry, I got the loot.

22:09.997 --> 22:12.667
[♪ closing theme song playing]
